se and attach'))}}</button></template></div><small v-if="cutMode" class="cut-help">{{zh?'依次点击模型顶点，沿网格连接切分线；选中点也会同步到右侧，可插入新点。Shift＋中键拖动可平移。':localize('Click consecutive vertices to connect cuts along the mesh. Refine the selected edge in the inspector.')}}</small><Teleport v-if="mode==='cutting'" to="#surface-cut-draft" defer><div v-if="sectionDraft" class="section-cut-draft" aria-label="Section workspace editor"><strong>{{zh?'模型截面环线':localize('Model section ring')}}</strong><label>{{zh?'截面名称':localize('Section name')}}<input v-model="sectionDraft.name" maxlength="120"></label><label>{{zh?'截面轴':localize('Axis')}}<select v-model="sectionDraft.axis"><option>x</option><option>y</option><option>z</option></select></label><label>{{zh?'截面位置 mm':localize('Section position mm')}}<input :value="Number(sectionDraft.positionMm.toFixed(3))" type="number" step=".001" @input="sectionDraft.positionMm=Number(($event.target as HTMLInputElement).value)"></label><details><summary>{{zh?'截面部件':localize('Section parts')}} · {{sectionDraft.regions.length}}</summary><label v-for="r in drawingRegions" :key="r"><input v-model="sectionDraft.regions" type="checkbox" :value="r">{{r}}</label></details><p role="status">{{sectionPreview.error?(zh?'此位置未与所选部件相交，请点击模型上的有效位置。':localize('No intersection with the selected parts. Click a valid model position.')):(zh?'点击模型定位；拖动橙色环线或圆点调整位置，保存前可撤销或取消。':localize('Click the model to place; drag the orange ring or handle to adjust. Undo or cancel before saving.'))}}</p><button :disabled="store.busy||!sectionDraft.name.trim()||!sectionDraft.regions.length||!!sectionPreview.error" @click="saveSection">{{zh?'保存截面环线':localize('Save section ring')}}</button><button :disabled="store.busy" @click="cancelSection">{{zh?'取消截面修改':localize('Cancel section edits')}}</button></div><div v-if="curveDrawing" class="curve-cut-draft"><strong v-if="curveTool==='brush'">{{zh?'裁切画笔 · 按住左键拖动':localize('Cut brush · hold the left mouse button and drag')}}</strong><label>{{zh?'裁剪线名称':lo